# L9f: the dark notch across the L9e Cube slab at the MIDDLE control point (the joint of the two segments).
# Same road and slab as L9e.scn; cameras low and close at the joint (9282, ~1400, -1906), then the slab lifted
# 100 cm (UE CenterAdjust): a notch that survives the lift is in the joint geometry, one that goes was ground.
# The scenario does not save; still `git checkout -- Projects/Desert/Content/Scenes/G3_TwoTerrains*` after a play.
